(PID.TID 0019.0001) >#               > 0 : write time-average output every frequency seconds
(PID.TID 0019.0001) >#  timePhase(n)     : write at time = timePhase + multiple of |frequency|
(PID.TID 0019.0001) >#    averagingFreq  : frequency (in s) for periodic averaging interval
